  "description": "IMEX.Core v2.0: High-performance Hybrid Cache library for .NET 8/9 with 15% performance improvement. Features: L1/L2 caching, single-flight coalescing, SWR (stale-while-revalidate), fail-safe fallback, thread-safe operations, Redis integration, circuit breaker, SqlSugar ORM, comprehensive logging/monitoring, and production-ready security.",
